    <string name="dlg_usage_title">HOW TO USE DAILY PLANNER</string>
    <string name="usage_content">&#x1F4CB; ORGANIZE YOUR IDEAS\n\n&#x1F5C2; 1. CREATE YOUR LISTS\nGroup by theme (Work, Studies, Personal) and use colors to find them quickly.\n\n&#x2705; 2. ADD TASKS\nTap \"New Task\", enter a title and you\'re done.\n\n&#x1F501; 3. SCHEDULED TASKS\nEnable \"Scheduled Task\" to set reminders and repeat habits.\n\n&#x1F4C5; 4. SMART CALENDAR\nSee completed and upcoming tasks in the calendar.\n\n&#x1F4BE; 5. SECURE BACKUP\nExport or import backups to keep your data safe.\n\nStart now and get more focus in your day.</string>
